@startuml
title UC - Register / Login

start

:1. Open login/register page;
:2. Enter email and password;

if (3. Select Register?) then (Yes - Customer)
  :4. Enter registration details;
  :5. Submit registration form;
  :6. System creates customer account;
  :7. Show registration confirmation;

else (No - Login)
  :8. Submit login request;
  :9. System validates credentials;

  if (10. Credentials valid?) then (Yes)
    :11. Display user dashboard;
  else (No)
    :12. Display "Email or Password Incorrect";
  endif
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. User opens the login/register page.
2. User enters email and password.
3. User chooses whether to register or log in.
4. If registering (Customer only), user enters required details.
5. User submits the registration form.
6. System creates a new customer account.
7. System shows registration confirmation.
8. If logging in, user submits login request.
9. System validates the credentials.
10. System checks whether credentials are valid.
11. If valid, system displays the appropriate dashboard.
12. If invalid, system displays an error message.

end note

@enduml